"  Transfers   Share   Settings                            ↓9.8M  ↑1.6M  [green] "
"────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"
" Restart the daemon to apply changes to: peers.                                 "
"   Active downloads                  3 •                                        "
"   Active uploads                    no limit                                   "
"                                                                                "
" Sharing limits                                                                 "
" When a complete transfer stops sharing. A transfer can have its own limits.    "
"   Ratio                             2.0                                        "
"   Time                              12h                                        "
"   Idle timeout                      10m                                        "
"   When a limit is reached           stop sharing                               "
"                                                                                "
" Network                                                                        "
" On by default so peers can reach you behind a home router. Each can be turned  "
" off. Select a row to see what it reveals.                                      "
"   Port mapping                      [ ●] on                                    "
"   Relays from trackers              [ ●] on                                    "
"   LAN discovery                     [● ] off                                   "
"                                                                                "
" Trackers                                                                       "
" Transfers announce themselves to these trackers, plus the ones named in their  "
" link, so peers can find them.                                                  "
"▌  https://tracker.example.org/announce                                         "
"────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"
" enter changes the URL; x removes it.                                           "
"                                                                                "
" • marks settings that override the config file.                                "
"────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"
" j/k move  enter change  a add  x remove/reset  : commands  1-3 areas  ? help   "
